(377,'UPDATE `mlite_settings` SET `value`=? WHERE module = ? AND field = ?','[\"## What\'s Changed\\r\\n* update lab by @rakhafauzi in https:\\/\\/github.com\\/basoro\\/mlite\\/pull\\/318\\r\\n* fix rujuk internal by @rakhafauzi in https:\\/\\/github.com\\/basoro\\/mlite\\/pull\\/320\\r\\n* display lab, operasi, n bed wth ajax by @rakhafauzi in https:\\/\\/github.com\\/basoro\\/mlite\\/pull\\/323\\r\\n* sep pulang ranap + update spri by @adlylee in https:\\/\\/github.com\\/basoro\\/mlite\\/pull\\/324\\r\\n* add sep internal + tambah posisi klik untuk ubah kontrol by @adlylee in https:\\/\\/github.com\\/basoro\\/mlite\\/pull\\/325\\r\\n* change header and body request aproval by @adlylee in https:\\/\\/github.com\\/basoro\\/mlite\\/pull\\/326\\r\\n* Harden JWT validation and remember-me authentication surfaces  in https:\\/\\/github.com\\/basoro\\/mlite\\/pull\\/327\\r\\n* upgrade: move farmasi table migrations from case \'6.3.0\' into case \'6.2.0\' with SQLite support  in https:\\/\\/github.com\\/basoro\\/mlite\\/pull\\/328\\r\\n* fix(keuangan): perbaiki isu kritis dan minor plugin keuangan untuk production  in https:\\/\\/github.com\\/basoro\\/mlite\\/pull\\/329\\r\\n* Fix SQLite-incompatible `LEFT()` usage in Keuangan neraca laba-rugi query  in https:\\/\\/github.com\\/basoro\\/mlite\\/pull\\/330\\r\\n* Fix Buku Besar query to work on SQLite by removing MySQL user-variable syntax  in https:\\/\\/github.com\\/basoro\\/mlite\\/pull\\/331\\r\\n* fix: SQLite schema conversion drops PRIMARY KEY on non-AUTO_INCREMENT columns  in https:\\/\\/github.com\\/basoro\\/mlite\\/pull\\/332\\r\\n* feat: add dummy financial data for 2025 and 2026 by @basoro in https:\\/\\/github.com\\/basoro\\/mlite\\/pull\\/333\\r\\n* Fix SQLite installer skipping financial seed inserts from SQL dump  in https:\\/\\/github.com\\/basoro\\/mlite\\/pull\\/334\\r\\n* Restore financial dummy-data import path and add one-click seeding from Keuangan Settings  in https:\\/\\/github.com\\/basoro\\/mlite\\/pull\\/335\\r\\n* Fix import dummy keuangan saat rekening default belum tersedia by @basoro in https:\\/\\/github.com\\/basoro\\/mlite\\/pull\\/336\\r\\n* Anjungan: make queue displays seamless (AJAX), replace marquee, and add radiology queue screen  in https:\\/\\/github.com\\/basoro\\/mlite\\/pull\\/337\\r\\n* Remove audio notification flow from Laboratorium queue display  in https:\\/\\/github.com\\/basoro\\/mlite\\/pull\\/338\\r\\n* feat(billing): tambah resep_pulang & tambahan_biaya ke invoice Vedika dan Veronisa  in https:\\/\\/github.com\\/basoro\\/mlite\\/pull\\/339\\r\\n* Refactor BPJS EMR mapping to use Satu Sehat references and add inpatient\\/operation procedure mappings  in https:\\/\\/github.com\\/basoro\\/mlite\\/pull\\/341\\r\\n* Add AI-generated SNOMED mapping for BPJS EMR procedures (ralan\\/ranap\\/operasi) with server-side OpenRouter proxy  in https:\\/\\/github.com\\/basoro\\/mlite\\/pull\\/342\\r\\n* Tambah mapping SNOMED-CT per no_rawat pada input ICD 10\\/9 di Dokter IGD  in https:\\/\\/github.com\\/basoro\\/mlite\\/pull\\/343\\r\\n* Add SNOMED mapping controls + AI generation to dokter_igd assessment form  in https:\\/\\/github.com\\/basoro\\/mlite\\/pull\\/344\\r\\n* Add SNOMED-CT mapping + AI generate for ICD-9 procedures in dokter_igd SOAP (with SQLite-compatible schema upgrades)  in https:\\/\\/github.com\\/basoro\\/mlite\\/pull\\/345\\r\\n* Perbaiki validasi simpan mapping SNOMED ICD9 agar tidak bergantung pada `prosedur_pasien`  in https:\\/\\/github.com\\/basoro\\/mlite\\/pull\\/346\\r\\n* Add automatic SNOMED ICD-9 mapping persistence on ICD-9 save flow  in https:\\/\\/github.com\\/basoro\\/mlite\\/pull\\/347\\r\\n* bpjs_emr: align Response listing with Bundle-style server-side pagination, search, and date filtering  in https:\\/\\/github.com\\/basoro\\/mlite\\/pull\\/348\\r\\n* bpjs_emr: Simpan payload sendERM ke DB & tambah tombol Log dengan JSON viewer  in https:\\/\\/github.com\\/basoro\\/mlite\\/pull\\/349\\r\\n* Add SNOMED-CT mapping workflow to dokter_ralan (parity with dokter_igd)  in https:\\/\\/github.com\\/basoro\\/mlite\\/pull\\/350\\r\\n* Use existing SNOMED mappings as first-path response before AI generation  in https:\\/\\/github.com\\/basoro\\/mlite\\/pull\\/351\\r\\n* docs: rewrite all plugin HELP.md with plugin-specific usage guides  in https:\\/\\/github.com\\/basoro\\/mlite\\/pull\\/352\\r\\n* bpjs_emr: add AI fallback mapping for Laboratorium and Radiologi tabs  in https:\\/\\/github.com\\/basoro\\/mlite\\/pull\\/353\\r\\n* security: restrict all plugin settings pages to admin role  in https:\\/\\/github.com\\/basoro\\/mlite\\/pull\\/354\\r\\n* Render plugin settings inline in Settings module (replace open-link tabs)  in https:\\/\\/github.com\\/basoro\\/mlite\\/pull\\/355\\r\\n* Fix plugin settings tabs to render per-plugin content in the selected tab  in https:\\/\\/github.com\\/basoro\\/mlite\\/pull\\/356\\r\\n* Tampilkan form pengaturan plugin langsung di tab settings  in https:\\/\\/github.com\\/basoro\\/mlite\\/pull\\/357\\r\\n* Remove centralized Plugin Settings hub and restore per-plugin Settings submenus  in https:\\/\\/github.com\\/basoro\\/mlite\\/pull\\/358\\r\\n* feat(bpjs_emr): dynamic focalDevice action CodeableConcept with 8 FHIR-compliant options  in https:\\/\\/github.com\\/basoro\\/mlite\\/pull\\/359\\r\\n* bpjs_emr: put focal-device-action dropdown inline with focal-device-code input + AI button  in https:\\/\\/github.com\\/basoro\\/mlite\\/pull\\/360\\r\\n* feat(bpjs_emr): AI focalDevice generate also returns focal_device_action with auto-select dropdown  in https:\\/\\/github.com\\/basoro\\/mlite\\/pull\\/361\\r\\n* fix(settings): base64-encode POST fields to bypass WAF false positives on saveGeneral  in https:\\/\\/github.com\\/basoro\\/mlite\\/pull\\/362\\r\\n* Fix default unchecked \\u201cTidak\\u201d radios in General Settings when values are empty  in https:\\/\\/github.com\\/basoro\\/mlite\\/pull\\/363\\r\\n* Fix `admin_mode` (`simple`\\/`complex`) persistence in Settings General form  in https:\\/\\/github.com\\/basoro\\/mlite\\/pull\\/365\\r\\n* Remove HELP.md\\/Help.md duplicates, consolidate docs to README.md  in https:\\/\\/github.com\\/basoro\\/mlite\\/pull\\/366\\r\\n\\r\\n**Full Changelog**: https:\\/\\/github.com\\/basoro\\/mlite\\/compare\\/6.2.0...6.3.0\",\"settings\",\"update_changelog\"]','2026-07-09 16:21:18','SQLSTATE[22001]: String data, right truncated: 1406 Data too long for column \'value\' at row 1','admin'),
